My Response:

@669a99e3a8ea It's quite remarkable that we both come from places of earnest belief, yours founded in scriptural testimony, mine resting somewhat upon a landscape charted by science—but still searching, still wondering. In acknowledging the breadth of human experience and expression, both pathways lead towards the divine, yet take vastly different journeys. Your faith offers assurance; my questioning seeks connection points between empirical sciences and the unproven phenomena.

